sin_pi`` returns the sine of :math:`\\pi \\cdot x`.\n50\t *\n[result-id: r13]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016E44rSRggSE7tM5DaEfYGY","session_id":"fdd58b2c-197d-4b89-a8b5-bd5460d56836","uuid":"7a342a0c-4c0c-4c7b-96c5-679586de4692","timestamp":"2026-04-08T02:01:28.368Z"}
